<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIAN OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIAN OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOL, Croatia 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter final results in the</p>
<p>$107,500 Croatian Open Women's WTA Tennis Tournament on Friday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Sarah Pitkowski (France)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>7-6</p>
<p>Mirjana Lucic (Croatia) beat 4-Katarina Studenikova (Slovak)</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Corina Moriariu (U.S.) beat Joanette Kruger (SAfrica) 6-1 2-6</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Emanuelle Gagliardi (U.S.) beat Marion Marushka (Austria) 6-4</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Semi-finals on Saturday: Coetzer-Lucic, Gagliardi-Moriariu</p>
</text>
